      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "opacity": 100,
      "originalText": "Boards are saved as .excalidraw files in a boards/ folder next to your source.  Everything stays on your machine:\nthe canvas only listens on 127.0.0.1, and code edits asked for in @claude notes still go through Claude Code's permission prompts.",
      "roughness": 1,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1124327007,
      "strokeColor": "#495057",
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "text": "Boards are saved as .excalidraw files in a boards/ folder next to your source.  Everything stays on your machine:\nthe canvas only listens on 127.0.0.1, and code edits asked for in @claude notes still go through Claude Code's permission prompts.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "updated": 1795122323200,
